// S = A xor B xor Ci, Co = (A and B) or ((A xor B) and Ci); Co comes out on top.
name Full adder
port a A in
port b B in
port i CI in
port s S out
port o CO out
alu U iron
chip U 0 XOR
chip U 1 XOR
chip U 2 AND
chip U 3 AND
chip U 4 OR
wire U in:W 0:A
wire U in:N 0:B
wire U 0:Q 1:A
wire U in:S 1:B
wire U 1:Q out:E
wire U in:W 2:A
wire U in:N 2:B
wire U 0:Q 3:A
wire U in:S 3:B
wire U 2:Q 4:A
wire U 3:Q 4:B
wire U 4:Q out:U
layer
..b.
..-.
a-Us
..-.
..i.
layer
....
....
..o.
